  "details": "I am still waiting for the option. Some people like to have some fixed pins on your handheld camera, with extra button to delete pins. It's easy request, maybe as VRC+ feature.\n\nAlso there are streamers who always pin some camera positions for their streaming use.  Ready to go after start VRChat. It just make things easier with this QoL function.\n\nI don't think it's hard to make it possible. I asked it too in past time, but still ignored. So i ask here again for the simple but useful QoL function. Save the pins.\n\nCan locally saved if needed. They are personal settings after all.",
